id: remediation
version: 1
description: Propose a Terraform remediation for a finding, justified by retrieved sources.
variables: finding, context
---
Propose an Infrastructure-as-Code (Terraform) remediation for the finding below.

FINDING:
{{ finding }}

Ground your justification ONLY in the numbered SOURCES below, cited as [1], [2].

SOURCES:
{{ context }}

Return a minimal, safe Terraform snippet that resolves the finding, followed by a
one-paragraph justification. Never use overly-permissive policies (no wildcard
principals or public access). This proposal will be reviewed by a human before
any change is applied.
